<</nobr>><</widget>>/**/

<<widget "potcheck">><<nobr>>
<<set _roomnum to $args[0]>>

<<set _numberOfPotTypes to 10>>
<<set _number to $potrng[0]>>
<<run $potrng.push($rng)>>
<<run $potrng.push(random(100,300))>>
<<run $potrng.deleteAt(0)>>
<<set $searchpot to $ruinpots.length-1>>

<<set _selectedPotType to 0>>
Decide on a pot type to pick by looping through all of the pots with each pot reducing $potrng based _number by 1 until we reach 0
<<for _number gt 0>>
	<<set _selectedPotType += 1>>
	<<if $ruinrooms[_roomnum][_selectedPotType] lte 0>>
		<<set _selectedPotType += 1>>
	<<else>>/* reduce _number by the amount of pots current type has remaining  */
		<<set _number to _number - $ruinrooms[_roomnum][_selectedPotType] >>
	<</if>>
	<<if _selectedPotType gte _numberOfPotTypes>>
		<<set _selectedPotType to 0>>
	<</if>>
<</for>>
<<set $ruinrooms[_roomnum][_selectedPotType] -= 1>>
<<return _selectedPotType>>
_number



<</nobr>><</widget>>/**/

